    "name":  "LED Wall Light AERO 12W Round 3CCT Adjustable 310° IP65 SMD3030 Osram",
    "reference":  "RWLB12W-CCT-92257",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound LED wall light AERO 12W adjustable 310° IP65 with Osram SMD3030 chip and EagleRise driver,\u003c/strong\u003e designed for indoor and outdoor lighting. \u003cstrong\u003eFeatures selectable 3CCT\u003c/strong\u003e (3000K, 4000K and 6000K), 110 lm/W and a wide \u003cstrong\u003e120° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e for uniform lighting. Made of matte black aluminium with a frosted glass diffuser, it offers high durability and a modern design. Dimensions 140x38x164 mm, ideal for façades, terraces, entrances and walkways.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Wall Light AERO 12W | 3CCT | IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eRound LED Wall Light AERO 12W Adjustable 310°\u003c/strong\u003e combines modern design, durability and versatility for indoor and outdoor lighting. It features an \u003cstrong\u003eOsram SMD3030 chip\u003c/strong\u003e and an \u003cstrong\u003eEagleRise driver\u003c/strong\u003e, delivering \u003cstrong\u003e110 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and uniform lighting thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003e120° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT\u003c/strong\u003e system lets you choose between \u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K and 6000K\u003c/strong\u003e, easily adapting the colour temperature to different environments and lighting needs. In addition, its \u003cstrong\u003ematte black aluminium\u003c/strong\u003e body and \u003cstrong\u003efrosted glass diffuser\u003c/strong\u003e provide an elegant look and a robust construction.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMain features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower:\u003c/strong\u003e 12W\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED chip:\u003c/strong\u003e SMD3030 Osram\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriver:\u003c/strong\u003e EagleRise\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEfficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e 110 lm/W\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColour temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e 3CCT – 3000K / 4000K / 6000K\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeam angle:\u003c/strong\u003e 120°\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdjustment:\u003c/strong\u003e up to \u003cstrong\u003e310°\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoltage:\u003c/strong\u003e AC 220–240V\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProtection:\u003c/strong\u003e IP65\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c/strong\u003e Aluminium\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c/strong\u003e Matte black\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiffuser:\u003c/strong\u003e Frosted glass\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c/strong\u003e 140 × 38 × 164 mm\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eUses and applications\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003eadjustable IP65 LED wall light\u003c/strong\u003e is suitable for \u003cstrong\u003efaçades, terraces, entrances, patios, walkways and outdoor spaces\u003c/strong\u003e, as well as for indoor lighting projects requiring a compact, directional luminaire.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003e310°\u003c/strong\u003e adjustment allows the light to be aimed exactly where it is needed, making it easy to create functional or decorative lighting according to the requirements of each installation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn efficient and versatile LED solution for residential, commercial and professional projects seeking \u003cstrong\u003elighting quality, durability and installation flexibility\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
